menu "Universal GNSS administration"
    config UG_WEB_HTTP
        bool "Explicit experimental HTTP administration on the S3 LAN"
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
        default n
        help
            Selects HTTP at build time. Credentials and sessions cross the LAN
            without encryption. This is never a fallback from a TLS failure.
            Existing NVS identities and TLS for NTRIP are retained. Web Serial
            is unavailable from an HTTP LAN origin; use a separate USB tool.
endmenu
